            "sid": "AMO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka wat pa jacwo m'otho, ŋata waŋo delkwoŋ go, bino tero delkwoŋ go woko ma ot. Wat no bino lwoŋo ŋata nitie i ot ni, “Nitie ŋatiman manitie kodin kenyo?” Dwondi nyatoro bino waco ni, “Be!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
